{"task_id": "HumanEval/55", "solution": "def fib(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Return n-th Fibonacci number.\n    >>> fib(10)\n    55\n    >>> fib(1)\n    1\n    >>> fib(8)\n    21\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise TypeError(\"n must be an int\")\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    is_negative = False\n    if n < 0:\n        is_negative = True\n        n = -n\n\n    def _fib_doubling_pair(k):\n        # returns (F_k, F_{k+1})\n        if k == 0:\n            return (0, 1)\n        a, b = _fib_doubling_pair(k // 2)\n        c = a * (2 * b - a)      # F_{2m}\n        d = a * a + b * b        # F_{2m+1}\n        if k % 2 == 0:\n            return (c, d)\n        else:\n            return (d, c + d)\n\n    result, _ = _fib_doubling_pair(n)\n    if is_negative and n % 2 == 0:\n        return -result\n    return result"}
