{"task_id": "HumanEval/75", "solution": "def is_multiply_prime(a):\n    \"\"\"Checks if a number is the product of exactly three prime numbers (counting multiplicity).\"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(a, int) or a < 2:\n        return False\n\n    n = a\n    count = 0\n    i = 2\n\n    while i * i <= n:\n        while n % i == 0:\n            n //= i\n            count += 1\n            if count > 3:\n                return False\n        i += 1\n\n    if n > 1:\n        count += 1\n\n    return count == 3"}
